rooms_desc ({"You are in the front garden of a lovely thatched-roof cottage nestled in the beautiful English Cotswolds. The roses are in full bloom and the window boxes are overflowing with scarlet red geraniums. Please go in and make yourself at home. North","You have entered a small but cozy sitting room. On the south and west wallsare windows covered with curtains, that match the sofa and chairs, decorated ina Laura Ashley print. A warm fire glows in the fireplace located on the east wall.  Come on back to the kitchen. Mom is waiting for you.  North","You immediatly feel you are welcome here. An old shiny black woodstoveon the east wall is filling the room with warmth and the mouth-wateringaroma of apple pie baking to a rich golden brown. A pot of soup simmersalong side a softly whistling tea kettle. On the west wall, standing proudly,is an old oak cupboard showing off a collection of antique Wedgewoodchina. In the middle of the room is an old butcher block kitchen table wornwhite with years of use. There are four chairs surrounding the table inviting you to sit and rest your mind and body. Sitting on the table is a Cookie Monstercookie jar filled to the brim with Toll House chocolate chip cookies. Nearby stands a frosty pitcher of ice cold milk. Have some cookies and milk, or teaif you perfer.You are welcome here anytime to sit and chat and leave the rest of the worldbehind.","This room is for the use of my love and I only.It is dimly lit by the glow from a roaring fireplace on the north wall.In front of the fireplace stand two chairs. One has no arms and is lowto the floor. The other has an ornately carved high back and large arms.On the floor in front of the fireplace is the fur of a large polar bear.Coming out from the south wall, is a very large round platform bed covered infur throws of all types and colours. Two large fur covered pillows set at the head of the bed.This room is has been made by two people who love each other very much,and plan on spending hours together sharing that love with each other.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
